<title>FRANCE: Bongrain suspended limit down - SBF.</title>
<headline>Bongrain suspended limit down - SBF.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in French food group Bongrain were suspended limit down, the SBF French stockmarkets association said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Trading should re-open at 1015 A.M. (0815 GMT), the SBF spokesman said.</p>
